        "parts": [
          "Hier eine **vollständige Programming Languages Agent Section**, ready zum Copy-&-Paste in euer Repo oder eure Docs:\n\n---\n\n## Programming Languages Agent\n\nEin modularer Agent, der spezialisierte Code-Assistenz für diverse Sprachen (Python, Go, JavaScript/TypeScript, Java, …) bietet – per GPT-API, Linting, Formatter und Snippet-Generator:\n\n### 1. Verzeichnisstruktur\n\n```plaintext\ngo-bridge/\n└── pkg/\n    └── codeagent/\n        ├── common/               # shared GPT-Client & Prompt-Builder\n        │   ├── client.go\n        │   └── prompt_builder.go\n        ├── python_agent/         # Python-spezielles Modul\n        │   ├── client.go\n        │   ├── formatter.go      # black wrapper\n        │   └── linter.go         # pylint wrapper\n        ├── go_agent/             # Go-spezielles Modul\n        │   ├── client.go\n        │   ├── formatter.go      # gofmt\n        │   └── vet.go            # go vet\n        ├── js_agent/             # JavaScript/TypeScript\n        │   ├── client.ts\n        │   ├── formatter.ts      # Prettier wrapper\n        │   └── linter.ts         # ESLint wrapper\n        └── java_agent/           # Java\n            ├── client.go\n            ├── formatter.go      # google-java-format\n            └── linter.go         # Checkstyle wrapper\n```\n\n### 2. Gemeinsamer GPT-Client (`pkg/codeagent/common/client.go`)\n\n```go\npackage common\n\nimport (\n  \"context\"\n  \"encoding/json\"\n  \"net/http\"\n  \"bytes\"\n)\n\ntype Client struct {\n  Endpoint, APIKey string\n}\n\nfunc NewClient(endpoint, apiKey string) *Client {\n  return &Client{Endpoint: endpoint, APIKey: apiKey}\n}\n\nfunc (c *Client) Ask(ctx context.Context, prompt string) (string, error) {\n  reqBody, _ := json.Marshal(map[string]string{\"prompt\": prompt})\n  req, _ := http.NewRequestWithContext(ctx, \"POST\", c.Endpoint, bytes.NewReader(reqBody))\n  req.Header.Set(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \"+c.APIKey)\n  req.Header.Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n  resp, err := http.DefaultClient.Do(req)\n  if err != nil { return \"\", err }\n  defer resp.Body.Close()\n  var result struct{ Text string }\n  if err := json.NewDecoder(resp.Body).Decode(&result); err != nil {\n    return \"\", err\n  }\n  return result.Text, nil\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Python Agent (`pkg/codeagent/python_agent/client.go`)\n\n```go\npackage python_agent\n\nimport (\n  \"context\"\n  \"fmt\"\n  \"github.com/GenesisAeon/unifiedmandala/go-bridge/pkg/codeagent/common\"\n)\n\ntype Request struct{ Description string }\ntype Response struct{ Code string }\n\ntype PythonAgent struct{ client *common.Client }\n\nfunc NewPythonAgent(ep, key string) *PythonAgent {\n  return &PythonAgent{client: common.NewClient(ep, key)}\n}\n\n// GenerateSnippet erzeugt einen Python-Code-Schnipsel\nfunc (a *PythonAgent) GenerateSnippet(ctx context.Context, req Request) (Response, error) {\n  prompt := fmt.Sprintf(\"Generate a Python function for: %s\", req.Description)\n  code, err := a.client.Ask(ctx, prompt)\n  return Response{Code: code}, err\n}\n```\n\n_Python formatter & linter_ rufen einfach die CLI-Tools (`black`, `pylint`) via `os/exec` auf und returnen Ausgaben.\n\n### 4. UI-Component: CodeAgentPanel\n\n```tsx\nimport React, { useState } from 'react'\nimport { Button, Textarea, Dropdown } from '@/components/ui'\nimport { invoke } from '@/lib/api'\n\nexport function CodeAgentPanel() {\n  const [lang, setLang] = useState('python')\n  const [desc, setDesc] = useState('')\n  const [result, setResult] = useState('')\n\n  async function run() {\n    const res = await invoke(`/codeagent/${lang}/generate`, { description: desc })\n    setResult(res.code)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded\">\n      <Dropdown value={lang} onChange={setLang} options={['python','go','typescript','java']} />\n      <Textarea value={desc} onChange={e => setDesc(e.target.value)} placeholder=\"Describe the snippet…\" />\n      <Button onClick={run}>Generate {lang} Snippet</Button>\n      {result && <pre className=\"mt-2 bg-gray-100 p-2 rounded\">{result}</pre>}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### 5. CLI-Entrypoint (`cmd/mandala-codeagent.go`)\n\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n  \"context\"\n  \"flag\"\n  \"fmt\"\n  \"github.com/GenesisAeon/unifiedmandala/go-bridge/pkg/codeagent/python_agent\"\n  \"github.com/GenesisAeon/unifiedmandala/go-bridge/pkg/codeagent/go_agent\"\n  // imports for other agents...\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n  lang := flag.String(\"lang\",\"python\",\"language\")\n  desc := flag.String(\"desc\",\"\",\"description\")\n  ep   := flag.String(\"ep\",\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\",\"GPT endpoint\")\n  key  := flag.String(\"key\",\"\",\"API key\")\n  flag.Parse()\n\n  ctx := context.Background()\n  switch *lang {\n  case \"python\":\n    agent := python_agent.NewPythonAgent(*ep,*key)\n    resp,_ := agent.GenerateSnippet(ctx, python_agent.Request{Description:*desc})\n    fmt.Println(resp.Code)\n  case \"go\":\n    agent := go_agent.NewGoAgent(*ep,*key)\n    code,_ := agent.GenerateTests(ctx,*desc)\n    fmt.Println(code)\n  // weitere Sprach-Cases…\n  default:\n    fmt.Println(\"Unsupported language\")\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Security & Auditing\n\n- **Rate Limiting / Backoff** in `common.Client`  \n- **Input Sanitization** bei Link-Ingestion  \n- **Sigil-Logging** jeder Code-Aktion (Prompt-Hash, Language, Timestamp)\n\n---\n\nMit dieser **Programming Languages Agent Section** habt ihr ein komplettes Ökosystem für code-spezifische AI-Workflows, nahtlos integriert ins Mandala-Framework. Codex kann das jetzt in `advancedconversations.json` übernehmen und direkt implementieren!"
